@startuml sd_us106a
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title US106a - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "Backoffice Operator" as Actor
participant "Entry (Envoy)\nvirtual IP of airports-routes" as EAR
box "airports-routes-n (the replica that answers)" #F7F7F7
participant "AirportController" as AirportController
participant "AddAirportCertificationUseCase" as AddAirportCertificationUseCase
database "own database" as DBAR
participant "Outbox dispatcher" as OBAR
end box
collections "peer replicas\nairports-routes-m" as PAR
participant "aircraft-maintenance\n(through aircraft-maintenance-local)" as OAM
== POST /api/airports/{iataCode}/certifications ==
Actor -> EAR : POST /api/airports/{iataCode}/certifications\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAR -> AirportController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
AirportController -> AddAirportCertificationUseCase : execute(...)
AddAirportCertificationUseCase -> OAM : C3: GET /internal/aircraft-models/{name}\n(the actor's token)
OAM --> AddAirportCertificationUseCase : 200 whether the model exists
AddAirportCertificationUseCase -> DBAR : airport and aircraft model already in the catalog?
AddAirportCertificationUseCase -> DBAR : save aircraft certification + one copy per other replica in the outbox\n(same transaction)
AddAirportCertificationUseCase --> AirportController : created
AirportController --> Actor : 201 Created
OBAR -> PAR : PUT /internal/replicas/aircraft-certifications\n(to every other replica, retried until delivered)
PAR --> OBAR : 200 (applied if newer)
@enduml
